      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The gas analyzer is controlled via a portable Controller. Hold down the
    power button to turn it on.


    The Probe monitors the hazardousareas within
    a radius of 50 and reports the received data to the controller, including


    -
    Amount of detected zones

    - Information of the nearest one:

    -- ID

    --
    Size

    -- Distance to it'
